  'candidates[1].header': 'Polymarket 24.75% (up 0.40pp, vol USD 7.79M accumulated), but the gap WIDENS to +40.75pp because Lula rose more. He RISES 1.00pp in [first-round](/en/glossary#primeiro-turno) second place, to 79.50%, and FALLS to 4.95% in third. He remains WITHOUT a running mate four days from the Aug 5 deadline, after the PP\'s refusal.',
