  cruzamento: `THE CROSS-READING OF AUG 1 has a single axis in the market and it is yesterday's, now repeated. Lula ROSE 1.00pp and went to 65.50% (vol USD 7.82M), the MAXIMUM of the AFOS series, which runs from Apr 14 to today, for a second consecutive day. Flávio Bolsonaro ROSE 0.40pp, to 24.75% (vol USD 7.79M), and even so the gap WIDENED from +40.15pp to +40.75pp, also the maximum of the series that holds both names, which begins on May 3. On both days the record came with the opponent rising alongside, which describes demand for the front-runner and not deterioration on the other side. `
