    + `THE WHOLE CHASING PACK SHRANK, and that is the difference from yesterday, when the signals were crossed. CAIADO fell 0.25pp in the winner contract, to 1.35% (vol USD 5.24M), and COLLAPSED 5.00pp in the third-place book, from 27.50% to 22.50% (vol USD 37,000), undoing in one session the previous day's gain; the series caveat applies and does not describe a collapse, because his minimum is 0.90%, from Jul 9. CAMILO SANTANA gave back 0.90pp and went to 0.45% (vol USD 4.19M), his lowest value in the series, below the 0.50% of Jul 30: he rose from the minimum and went back below it in two sessions. Jair Bolsonaro fell 0.30pp, to 0.55%, Alckmin gave up 0.10pp, to 0.35%, and Zema was FLAT at 0.35%, interrupting four consecutive declines. ${TARCISIO_EN} `
    + `${PORTAS_EN} Tereza Cristina appears at 0.25% in the PRESIDENTIAL contract, up 0.05pp, and the distinction matters: that contract measures who wins the presidency, not who fills the running-mate slot. `
